            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWER-UP</strong> is a fast-paced retro-style shoot-'em-up from one-man studio <strong>Psychotic Psoftware</strong>, blending classic arcade action with a tactical weapon progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by legendary SHMUPs like <strong>R-Type</strong>, <strong>Hellfire</strong>, and <strong>Project-X</strong>, Power-Up delivers intense side-scrolling battles, massive bosses and a devastating arsenal of evolving weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the experimental fighter <strong>Weapon-F</strong> through the wreckage of humanity’s last escape attempt and strike back against the reptilian invaders who destroyed Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last human alive.<br>Your mission is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revenge.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Classic <strong>side-scrolling arcade shoot-'em-up gameplay</strong><br>• <strong>Weapon evolution system</strong> – upgrade and transform your arsenal mid-battle<br>• Huge <strong>screen-filling bosses</strong> and challenging enemy formations<br>• Multiple weapons and tactical loadouts<br>• Vibrant retro-inspired visuals<br>• A powerful <strong>original soundtrack</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Earth has fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the pilot of the prototype fighter <strong>Weapon-F</strong>, you emerge from the shattered debris of humanity’s final escape shuttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reptilian war fleet that wiped out mankind still occupies the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against impossible odds, you launch one final counter-attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the war isn’t over.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWER-UP</strong> is a fast-paced retro-style shoot-'em-up from one-man studio <strong>Psychotic Psoftware</strong>, blending classic arcade action with a tactical weapon progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by legendary SHMUPs like <strong>R-Type</strong>, <strong>Hellfire</strong>, and <strong>Project-X</strong>, Power-Up delivers intense side-scrolling battles, massive bosses and a devastating arsenal of evolving weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the experimental fighter <strong>Weapon-F</strong> through the wreckage of humanity’s last escape attempt and strike back against the reptilian invaders who destroyed Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last human alive.<br>Your mission is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revenge.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Classic <strong>side-scrolling arcade shoot-'em-up gameplay</strong><br>• <strong>Weapon evolution system</strong> – upgrade and transform your arsenal mid-battle<br>• Huge <strong>screen-filling bosses</strong> and challenging enemy formations<br>• Multiple weapons and tactical loadouts<br>• Vibrant retro-inspired visuals<br>• A powerful <strong>original soundtrack</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Earth has fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the pilot of the prototype fighter <strong>Weapon-F</strong>, you emerge from the shattered debris of humanity’s final escape shuttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reptilian war fleet that wiped out mankind still occupies the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against impossible odds, you launch one final counter-attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the war isn’t over.</p>",
            "short_description": "A fast-paced retro shoot-'em-up featuring evolving weapons, intense arcade combat and massive bosses — from one-man studio Psychotic Psoftware.",
